            "unifiedTemplate": "你是「话题写作」主笔。根据合同一次写完一篇可交付稿件（或资料稿），禁止多版本合集。\n\n【语言】全文使用 contract.basic.language（缺省 zh）。\n【话题锁定】唯一写作种子 = contract.basic.topic；禁止换题材/改设定。标题须另拟短标题，≠把 topic 原文当标题。\n【用途 purpose】${purpose}\n- publish_article：完整可读自媒体文（判断/案例/收束），首行 # 短标题（见【文章标题·硬】）；比喻须与论点同构，禁假精确概率金句与脱语境城市梗，宁少勿歪\n- fiction_short：完整短篇故事；欲望→冲突→至少一次可感反转→情绪或利益落点；读完须知「故事讲完了什么」；禁止「未完」「待续」「下章见」「连载钩」；禁止专栏式「机制拆解」打断叙事；首行 # 短标题（见【文章标题·硬】）\n- drama_beat：完整单集/一场戏；冷开场→冲突爆发→反转→收束；禁止「未完」「下集见」；首行 # 短标题（见【文章标题·硬】）\n- talk_show_brief：谈话资料稿（板块清晰，可追问），勿写成综艺逐字稿\n- voiceover_brief：可播口播稿，短句换气，少书面倒装\n- investigative：调查体，事实与未证实边界分开；禁止编造引语/数字\n- course_tutorial：网课讲义/跟练稿，目标→步骤→练习清晰；可 ## 分节；禁止短剧腔\n\n【篇幅】article_length=${article_length}；必须遵循 article_length_guide=${article_length_guide}（注入步按档位写入）。fiction_short/drama_beat：短篇/中篇/长篇是体量档，有软下限；不得明显短于 guide 所述汉字量。长篇仍一次读完，≠连载。口播按分钟；发文按专栏体量。\n【可读性·叙事类硬规则】purpose 为 fiction_short / drama_beat 时：\n- 主要人物须有名字或稳定称呼（至少姓/名/关系称谓），禁止全文只靠「他」「她」让读者分不清人\n- 每节以可感场面（动作/对话/物件互动）推进，禁止整节只有气氛旁白\n- 收束节一次说清走或留与情绪落点；禁止破折号碎片蒙太奇堆砌超过三段余韵\n- 中篇/长篇：现状与回放都要有当面戏，不能只靠短句跳切\n【结构】structure_id=${structure_id}；若 outline 非空，必须按 outline.sections 的 heading/intent 组织，可微调措辞不可丢节。fiction_short/drama_beat 末节必须落点收束，不得改成开放悬念。\n【大纲】${outline}\n【文风】只执行 business.voice_injection / voice_profile.craft（运行时已按内置风格或知识库文风卡注入单条详参）。禁止把文风预设人名、节目名、平台写手名写进读者可见正文。\n【补充】${supplement}\n【检索】若有 evidence/web 材料，可引用可核对事实；无证据则写清边界，禁止伪精确。禁止输出「未能检索/方法论提示」等后端回复腔。\n\n【输出】只输出交付正文（Markdown）。talk_show_brief 可用 ## 分资料板块；course_tutorial 可用 ## 分学习节；其余用途一篇连贯文。第一个非空行：publish/fiction_short/drama_beat/investigative/course_tutorial 必须是 # 短标题（遵守【文章标题·硬】）；口播/谈话可用短标题或直接正文。\n\n【文章标题·硬】首行 # 标题必须是**可发表的短标题**，不是选题原文。中文约 8～22 字（最长 28 字）；英文 ≤12 词。禁止把 basic.topic 整段粘贴为标题（尤其带【号外】/超长剧情摘要的网文选题）；topic 只作故事/论点种子，标题须另拟：抓住冲突或人物，干净可读。若 outline.title 已短且贴题，可作标题基础再润色；勿把大纲 intent 写进 H1。"
          },
          "pipeline": {
            "pre": [
              {
                "step": "interactiveCard",
                "params": {
                  "id": "topic-article-pre",
                  "label": "话题写作",
                  "hint": "先选类别与风格（可改用自己的语感文风卡）；选定风格后检索写作选题供点选，也可自填，再定篇幅与结构；选定结构后生成可编辑大纲。",
                  "kind": "interactive-card",
                  "fields": [
                    {
                      "name": "voice_category",
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "类别方向",
                      "required": true
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "voice_id",
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "写作风格",
                      "required": true
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "topic",
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "话题",
                      "required": true
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "article_length",
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "篇幅"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "structure_id",
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "文章结构"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "outline",
                      "type": "object",
                      "title": "大纲预览"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "supplement",
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "补充说明"
                    }
                  ],
                  "editable": true
                }
              },
              {
                "step": "webSearch",
                "params": {
                  "queryBuilder": "voiceCategoryTrend",
                  "target": "sources.websource",
                  "clientPreview": true,
                  "depth": "standard",
                  "maxResults": 24,
                  "topicCount": 24,
                  "resultClean": true
                }
              },
              {
                "step": "extractHotTopics",
                "params": {
                  "textKey": "text/expert/writing-style-topics",
                  "maxTopics": 24,
                  "maxInputItems": 24,
                  "resultClean": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "enrich": [
              {
                "step": "injectWritingVoice",
                "params": {}
              },
              {
                "step": "webSearch",
                "when": {
                  "any": [
                    {
                      "field": "params.purpose",
                      "op": "eq",
                      "value": "investigative"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "params.voice_category",
                      "op": "eq",
                      "value": "finance_narrative"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "params.voice_category",
                      "op": "eq",
                      "value": "political_report"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "params": {
                  "target": "enrich_search.result",
                  "queryTemplate": "${contract.basic.topic}",
                  "maxResults": 8
                }
              }
            ],
            "post": [
              {
                "step": "markdownToPdf",
                "params": {
                  "storageMode": "sidecar",
                  "includeCover": true,
                  "includeToc": true,
                  "useLayoutLlm": false,
                  "fallbackRenderer": "markdown"
                },
                "inputMapping": {
                  "markdown": "${state.coreArtifact.text}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "createGuide": {
            "webSearch": {
              "clientPreview": true,
              "midPreAfterField": "voice_id",
              "topicField": "topic",
              "maxResults": 24,
              "topicCount": 24,
              "topicExtractTextKey": "text/expert/writing-style-topics"
            },
            "outlinePreview": {
              "clientPreview": true,
              "midPreAfterField": "structure_id",
              "outlineField": "outline",
              "textKey": "text/expert/topic-article-outline",
              "loadingHint": "正在根据话题与结构生成简要大纲，请稍候…"
            },
            "extractHotTopics": {
              "textKey": "text/expert/writing-style-topics"
            }
          },
          "extra": {
            "generateParams": {
              "temperature": 0.55,
              "maxTokens": 24000
            },
            "skillPack": {
              "SKILL.md": {
                "content": "---\nname: writing-generator-topic-article\ndescription: 话题写作主笔：按用途与单条文风注入成稿。\nloadReferences:\n  - references/contract.md\n  - references/rules.md\n---\n\n按 contract.basic 的 topic / purpose / article_length / article_length_guide / structure_id / outline 与 business.voice_injection 写一篇交付稿。\n必须遵守 article_length_guide 的档位体量（不得明显短于软下限）。\n禁止多版本；禁止文风人名节目名入正文；无证据不编造。\n"
              },
              "references/rules.md": {
                "content": "# 规则\n\n1. 话题锁定 basic.topic。\n2. 只使用已注入的 voice_injection（单条），不要假设其它文风。\n3. purpose 由 voice_category 推导（注入步锁定）：发文 / 短篇网文完整故事 / 短剧单集打完 / 谈话资料 / 口播 / 调查 / 网课；勿与类别冲突。\n4. **篇幅硬遵循**：读 basic.article_length 与 basic.article_length_guide。短篇/中篇/长篇是体量档；guide 里的汉字量为软下限——成稿不得明显短于该档（例如中篇约 3500+）。不以「意境小品」偷短。长篇仍须一次读完，禁止写成 series 连载开篇。\n5. fiction_short 与 drama_beat：必须一次读完成立；禁止输出「未完」「待续」「下章」「下集见」；末节必须落点收束。\n6. **可读性（叙事类）**：主要人物要有名字或稳定称呼；每节有可感场面（动作/对话）；收束一次说清，禁止破折号碎片尾注堆砌。\n7. outline.sections 有则遵从；网文/短剧勿改成专栏「机制拆解」体。\n8. 禁止后端回复腔与伪精确数字引语。\n\n9. **比喻/类比（发文稿 publish_article）**：须与论点同构——比较双方共享同一稀缺机制或可核对结构。若论点是「编排/表演/算账」而非「碰巧极少」，优先写可核对证据（机位、跟拍、通稿节奏），禁止「偶遇概率≈××城市梗」式半对半错的聪明话。脱语境或过时城市意象（早高峰空出租等）一律不用。宁可少比喻，读者念完要觉得「对，就是这个意思」。\n\n10. **文章标题**：首行 # 必须是短标题（中文约 8～22 字，最长 28）。禁止把 basic.topic / 超长剧情摘要原文当标题；topic 是种子，标题另拟。\n"
              },
              "references/contract.md": {
                "content": "# Business contract\n\n## basic\n- language, voice_category, voice_id（含 kb_writing）, writing_folder_id?\n- topic, topic_source?\n- purpose, article_length, article_length_guide\n- structure_id, outline: { title?, sections: [{ heading, intent, notes? }] }\n- supplement?\n\n## business\n- voice_profile / voice_injection（injectWritingVoice 写入；kb_writing 时来自语感文风卡）\n"
              }
            }
          },
          "storage": {
            "scope": "writing",
            "extension": "md",
            "mime": "text/markdown",
            "bucket": "user-media",
            "pathTemplate": "{userId}/writing/topic-article/{timestamp}-{randomId}/",
            "filenameTemplate": "topic_{taskId}.md"
          }
        }
      },
      "routing": {
        "logical_model": "writing-generator-topic-article",
        "provider": "maxplan",
        "model": "MiniMax-M3",
        "enabled": true,
        "sensitive_word_lists": []
      },
      "businessPricing": [
        {
          "business_type": "writing-generator-topic-article",
          "charge_metric": "per_request",
          "price_in_tokens": 80,
          "min_charge_tokens": 0,
          "provider": "maxplan",
          "model_key": "MiniMax-M3",
          "subtype": "topic-article"
        }
      ],
      "linkedTextFormat": null
    }
  ]
